@startuml Starter State Machine
[*] --> Uninitialized : Spring Context loading

Uninitialized --> AutoConfigured : CrudEngineAutoConfiguration matching condition checks out

AutoConfigured --> ComponentsScanned : Component scan completes (classes found)
AutoConfigured --> InitializationError : Scanning / instantiation fails

ComponentsScanned --> StarterReady : All starter beans registered in Context
StarterReady --> [*]
InitializationError --> [*]
@enduml
